          <string>ZeroFlagLabs Shear Pin Forces &amp; Pressures Calculator  ·  v2.0.1

Estimates minimum and maximum direct shear failure loads of identical pins and optional differential release pressures.

Portable Windows application.

Original application code: MIT Licence.
PySide6/Qt and other third-party components retain their own licences. Any third-party reference datasets retain their respective rights and licences.</string>
